          </datasource-dependencies>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw].[Action (Resolution Code,Sub Level Issue,Top Level Issue,Vote)]'>
            <groupfilter function='crossjoin' user:ui-action-filter='[Action5_EA8885F9295B4C95B16BA9D47DFF86CF]' user:ui-enumeration='all' user:ui-marker='enumerate'>
              <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[ResolutionCode]' />
              <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[SubLevelDescription]' />
              <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[TopLevelDescription]' />
              <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[Vote]' />
            </groupfilter>
          </filter>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw].[Action (Resolution Code,Sub Level Issue,Top Level Issue,Vote)]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' value='59' />
            <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='label'>
            <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
            <format attr='font-family' field='[federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw].[none:Calculation_538743121764569088:nk]' value='Const' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='font-size' value='22' />
            <format attr='font-family' value='Courier New' />
            <format attr='color' value='#ffffff' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Circle' />
            <mark-sizing mark-sizing-setting='marks-scaling-off' />
            <encodings>
              <text column='[federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw].[none:Calculation_538743121764569088:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Index of Voting Cohesion (IVC)</run>
                <run>
IVC is computed using the voting data of countries participating within a voting bloc.  An IVC value of 1 indicates that all countries voting in the same direction for all included resolutions.  The lower the value the more disagreement among the participating countries.  The inspiration for using IVC was taken from the &quot;Reassessing the European Union in the United Nations General Assembly&quot; paper found here : https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/13501763.2014.919833.  The IVC computation can expressed as:

</run>
                <run italic='true'>ivc = (2 * ((n_y-1) * n_y + (n_n-1) * n_n + (n_a-1) * n_a + n_a * (n_y+n_n) - (N**2/2)+N)) / N**2</run>
                <run>&#10;where&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>    N = n_y + n_n + n_a</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>where </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>    n_y = (df[df.index.isin(blocs.get(bloc))] == &apos;Y&apos;).sum()</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>    n_n = (df[df.index.isin(blocs.get(bloc))] == &apos;N&apos;).sum()</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run italic='true'>    n_a = (df[df.index.isin(blocs.get(bloc))] == &apos;A&apos;).sum()</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Agenda Category</run>
                <run>
Machine learning techniques are applied to agenda title text.  Ultimately all of the agenda title text is reduced into the 4 most common words that represent 20 unique topics.  Agenda categories are derived using a Latent Dirichlet Allocation topic model.  The agenda title text is reduced into 20 unique topics using the LDA model.  Each topic is then represented by combining the top 4 most frequently occurring words with the topic.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-cull' value='true' />
                <format attr='size' value='1.263370156288147' />
                <format attr='has-stroke' value='true' />
                <format attr='stroke-color' value='#4e79a7' />
                <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='true' />
              </style-rule>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
